{"step_index":85,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T17:35:28Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-07T23:05:28+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-07T23:05:28+05:30\nShowing lines 615-725 of 1264\n615: \n616:     </section>\n617: \n618:     <!-- ========================================== -->\n619:     <!-- VIEW 5: VTU COMMUNITY PROJECT (1BCP308)   -->\n620:     <!-- ========================================== -->\n621:     <section id=\"view-project\" class=\"hidden max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6\">\n622:       \n623:       <!-- Academic Header -->\n624:       <div class=\"bg-govNavy text-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-lg border border-slate-700\">\n625:         <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 border-b border-slate-700\">\n626:           <div>\n627:             <span class=\"bg-amber-400 text-govNavy font-extrabold text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded\">VTU CURRICULUM</span>\n628:             <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-serif mt-2\">Course: Community Project (1BCP308)</h2>\n629:             <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-300\">Visvesvaraya Technological University, Belagavi, Karnataka</p>\n630:           </div>\n631:           <button onclick=\"window.print()\" class=\"bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/30 text-xs font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition flex items-center\">\n632:             <i class=\"fa-solid fa-print mr-1.5\"></i> Print Project Report Card\n633:           </button>\n634:         </div>\n635: \n636:         <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 text-xs\">\n637:           <div>\n638:             <p class=\"text-slate-400\">Project Domain</p>\n639:             <p class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm\">Smart Governance & Civic Tech</p>\n640:           </div>\n641:           <div>\n642:             <p class=\"text-slate-400\">Target Community</p>\n643:             <p class=\"font-bold text-white text-sm\">Local College Town / Urban Ward</p>\n644:           </div>\n645:           <div>\n646:             <p class=\"text-slate-400\">Sustainable Development Goals</p>\n647:             <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-400 text-sm\">SDG 11 & SDG 16</p>\n648:           </div>\n649:         </div>\n650:       </div>\n651: \n652:       <!-- Project Report Cards -->\n653:       <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 text-sm\">\n654:         \n655:         <!-- Problem Statement -->\n656:         <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-2\">\n657:           <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-rose-700 font-bold\">\n658:             <i class=\"fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation\"></i>\n659:             <h3 class=\"text-base text-govNavy font-serif\">1. Problem Statement</h3>\n660:           </div>\n661:           <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n662:             In semi-urban areas and student neighborhoods around educational institutions, civic problems like recurring potholes, overflowing garbage receptacles, burnt streetlights, and drainage blocks often go unnoticed or delayed due to the lack of an accessible, transparent, and direct reporting channel between citizens and municipal maintenance squads.\n663:           </p>\n664:         </div>\n665: \n666:         <!-- Proposed Solution -->\n667:         <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-2\">\n668:           <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-emerald-700 font-bold\">\n669:             <i class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\"></i>\n670:             <h3 class=\"text-base text-govNavy font-serif\">2. Proposed Solution</h3>\n671:           </div>\n672:           <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n673:             <strong>JanaSeva</strong> provides a lightweight web interface where residents and college students report grievances with photo evidence, landmark localization, and urgency tags. It automatically generates unique tracking codes, displays public resolution timelines, and ensures citizen privacy without exposing sensitive personal data.\n674:           </p>\n675:         </div>\n676: \n677:         <!-- UN SDG Mapping -->\n678:         <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-2\">\n679:           <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-amber-600 font-bold\">\n680:             <i class=\"fa-solid fa-earth-americas\"></i>\n681:             <h3 class=\"text-base text-govNavy font-serif\">3. UN SDG Alignment</h3>\n682:           </div>\n683:           <ul class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside\">\n684:             <li><strong>SDG 11: Sustainable Cities & Communities</strong> – Target 11.6: Managing municipal solid waste and improving municipal infrastructure quality.</li>\n685:             <li><strong>SDG 16: Strong Institutions</strong> – Promoting responsive, inclusive, participatory, and representative civic decision-making.</li>\n686:           </ul>\n687:         </div>\n688: \n689:         <!-- Student Presentation Notes -->\n690:         <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 space-y-2\">\n691:           <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-sky-700 font-bold\">\n692:             <i class=\"fa-solid fa-clipboard-check\"></i>\n693:             <h3 class=\"text-base text-govNavy font-serif\">4. Key Viva Questions Answered</h3>\n694:           </div>\n695:           <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n696:             <strong>Q: How is citizen privacy maintained?</strong><br>\n697:             A: The system only records public landmarks (e.g. Near Main Gate) and an optional citizen pseudonym. No private home address or mobile number is exposed on the public dashboard.\n698:           </p>\n699:         </div>\n700: \n701:       </div>\n702: \n703:     </section>\n704: \n705:   </main>\n706: \n707:   <!-- SUCCESS SUBMISSION MODAL -->\n708:   <div id=\"success-modal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n709:     <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-md w-full shadow-2xl text-center space-y-4 border border-slate-200 animate-in fade-in zoom-in duration-200\">\n710:       <div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-3xl\">\n711:         <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-check\"></i>\n712:       </div>\n713:       \n714:       <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-govNavy font-serif\">Grievance Successfully Lodged!</h3>\n715:       <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Your issue has been logged into the municipal dispatch queue.</p>\n716:       \n717:       <div class=\"bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-left space-y-1\">\n718:         <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 uppercase font-semibold\">Your Tracking Ticket ID:</p>\n719:         <p id=\"modal-ticket-id\" class=\"text-xl font-mono font-bold text-govNavy tracking-wider\">TKT-8942</p>\n720:         <p class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500\">Save this code to check progress in the \"Track Status\" tab.</p>\n721:       </div>\n722: \n723:       <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n724:         <button onclick=\"copyTicketAndTrack()\" class=\"flex-1 bg-govNavy hover:bg-govNavyLight text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg text-xs transition\">\n725:           <i class=\"fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass mr-1\"></i> Track Ticket Now"}
